            <div xml:id="m-79b9ebe1-7a8a-4281-9d45-b2011b4dd385">
              <lg xml:id="m-9c3e2015-0675-4d0e-8aab-525d7bb26c2c">
                <l xml:id="m-da9b7220-67f9-47cc-ac80-e3740374457b" facs="#m-46ace012-17a3-44e6-8aee-6d1cbfae2d26" label="text-like">Sunday at Prime.</l><l xml:id="m-5b38b909-ace7-4966-806a-5574fb8fd851" facs="#m-f36bd49c-691b-4117-a3f9-cf38aeb6643c" label="ambiguous">234</l><l xml:id="m-3c9954a8-280e-45a7-8b15-27e163ff1340" facs="#m-9d56582a-a5e8-405c-b90f-9e6dafc68e17" label="text-like">From the rst Sunday of Advent to Christmas Eve exclusive:</l><l xml:id="m-0ecf3e32-1fb2-4d3f-9fb4-2f441bd062e9" facs="#m-fcf2c445-c7d5-44fc-9ed7-582648dd801b" label="ambiguous">Isaias 33.</l><l xml:id="m-271d26ed-0548-4063-9a36-31e6603c8e95" facs="#m-27749e11-b074-4e9f-82b1-e13643bab093" label="ambiguous">Short Lesson.</l><l xml:id="m-a5cb32c3-2204-4ee0-9d22-06317dfeb653" facs="#m-7aaafa49-e066-40da-9ebf-be61a590b540" label="lyrics-like">Omine, miserére nostri : te enim ]in témpore tribulatiónis. Tu autem</l><l xml:id="m-53793ead-81ef-4cac-8975-dcb2140c9708" facs="#m-417a230a-c6e5-4a82-bfc9-89d705799ff4" label="lyrics-like">U exspectávimus:t esto bráchium</l><l xml:id="m-60af002a-d739-4b3a-8973-7146639378c1" facs="#m-621c6694-5570-4c55-b00b-395e3a9469ee" label="lyrics-like">Dómine miserére nobis.</l><l xml:id="m-94e8cdaa-14cb-44b3-9f82-ede485dff6c8" facs="#m-383b310b-9bea-4360-8dcd-64e75d532d0c" label="ambiguous">nostrum in mane, “ et salus nostra</l><l xml:id="m-13823983-9249-4bad-9de1-d0be85d30270" facs="#m-8558da2f-bcc7-4819-a4c6-e39c5c9373b0" label="text-like">From the Ist Sunday of Lent to Passion Sunday exclusive:</l><l xml:id="m-509eb178-8067-4a8e-92c2-2a40ba35836e" facs="#m-d8308c97-e7b8-4120-9d48-493bb51dcba5" label="ambiguous">Isaias 55.</l><l xml:id="m-596a7c45-8e7a-4799-96f9-d3fab703d975" facs="#m-9fdca4cc-9a7f-4e82-9b19-7d6ebe28c1c2" label="ambiguous">Short Lesson.</l><l xml:id="m-fedf98b3-3962-4501-8ecb-31158637443c" facs="#m-f9154467-3b80-4808-b0fd-35a54f7da6de" label="lyrics-like">Uaérite Dóminum, dum inve¬ dum prope est. Tu autem Dómine</l><l xml:id="m-8b083a58-c3ed-45de-a405-24c6eab67bc7" facs="#m-89266719-e5de-4f5c-81ac-186eb6d81a1a" label="lyrics-like">Uníri potest: * invocâte eum miserère nobis.</l><l xml:id="m-d3ca9dfa-a708-4c2f-8f4c-b563a8072088" facs="#m-f9cb02db-c988-418e-b8bb-a20f4e832c24" label="text-like">From Passion Sunday to Maundy Thursday exclusive:</l><l xml:id="m-4d1264e8-ba26-4bf3-9883-6fbf3ac254b8" facs="#m-14703a64-7394-4052-b84f-53ad1b3cf574" label="ambiguous">Short Lesson.</l><l xml:id="m-548c5225-e57b-4bbe-8a40-0ff93715424e" facs="#m-6c7fe6df-9ad1-493b-9ad3-dcf87e21db08" label="ambiguous">Isaias 50.</l><l xml:id="m-8de26073-1373-4fc4-ad67-20d0910a9661" facs="#m-81560fd4-e183-4d99-a345-3dfac1b1eb45" label="ambiguous">I</l><l xml:id="m-3c0a0bea-eed4-47d2-a0bf-1e2c39d5de6c" facs="#m-841c0cd0-7558-41a2-bb67-c1281806b129" label="lyrics-like">TAciem meam non avérti ab in- meus, * et ideo non sum confúsus.</l><l xml:id="m-f7855af6-71db-457d-9038-42e7920aa8da" facs="#m-7c7b987f-0ed4-4b03-83f4-bdcee6623562" label="lyrics-like">crepántibus, et conspuéntibus</l><l xml:id="m-8d0dd890-e8aa-41f3-aa35-bb5cac440bdc" facs="#m-a54446b8-a8a1-4ecb-9ef3-90365b4577c1" label="lyrics-like">Tu autem Dómine miserére nobis.</l><l xml:id="m-f8b101fa-2006-4ac3-b093-0a1ae541afb4" facs="#m-e2e6a958-2f45-44bd-bf48-cba11756dc0f" label="lyrics-like">in me. t Dóminus Deus auxiliátor</l><l xml:id="m-d58d6af1-49a7-42d8-b4a2-ec6dcbffe022" facs="#m-0c228e90-3236-42dd-a6bd-aca12b34f256" label="text-like">From Easter Sunday to the Ascension exclusine:</l><l xml:id="m-da0a661d-2611-4078-8716-8e2c0345ebf5" facs="#m-9d999f96-0fd5-49a2-8e16-d159c0030746" label="ambiguous">Short Lesson.</l><l xml:id="m-3e273095-0a1a-4642-84c4-9bf055f78b85" facs="#m-0257b729-42b9-4d1d-9635-7d8423efbed8" label="ambiguous">Coloss. 3.</l><l xml:id="m-46302f9d-fb71-4e05-83fc-df28c164e7af" facs="#m-07abc892-3414-4bb9-b484-27018774d0f6" label="lyrics-like">YI consurrexístis cum Christo, t l quae sursum sunt sápite, non quat</l><l xml:id="m-995c95bc-3d36-4745-b68e-44b78815ae34" facs="#m-be6b5208-a182-4d82-945d-8249e4417581" label="lyrics-like">O quae sursum sunt quaérite, ubi super terram. Tu autem Dómine</l><l xml:id="m-79fe81c5-b52b-449c-8e41-ca5abf5a1fa2" facs="#m-58dc5cef-a8da-4db3-b6d6-80979304bb38" label="lyrics-like">Christus est in déxtera Dei sedens:“ miserére nobis.</l><l xml:id="m-88dadfaa-7888-4044-8ccf-e0b28366f215" facs="#m-36941cfc-c401-442a-aebc-ecb48c4c98e4" label="text-like">On Feasts days, the Chapter of None of the Feast is said as the Short Lesson.</l><l xml:id="m-9fb2f2f5-f9a5-4ed4-8121-41be3f0ce9ce" facs="#m-9d7b7ccb-902e-4773-83e4-4c901bf78987" label="text-like">After the Short Lesson, the following is said:</l><l xml:id="m-34cfbf64-c74b-4c7b-9173-3a65d10a7ea4" facs="#m-6e28fc65-5843-4ef4-97fb-0fd5e67a6515" label="lyrics-like">V. Adju-tó-ri-um nóstrum in nómine Dómi-ni. R. Qui fé¬</l><l xml:id="m-02f8bb9a-189c-4aa1-853f-a31921c06b06" facs="#m-b9605173-9cf9-42d0-85a3-ddd3713db922" label="lyrics-like">cit caélum et térram. V. Benedí-ci-te. R. Dé-us.</l><l xml:id="m-9523396c-9c01-433a-b0ac-91d23edfd144" facs="#m-0881bc76-a2cb-4ce9-9c97-096a137f6e18" label="lyrics-like">Blessing Dóminus nos benedícat, et ab ómni málo deféndat:</l><l xml:id="m-668d8c17-7480-4fa8-adc2-178fdfd34f83" facs="#m-7ad5563e-dc70-4b7f-820a-0cc7ba0333cf" label="lyrics-like">et ad ví-tam perdúcat aetérnam. Et fidé-li-um ánimae</l><l xml:id="m-7c3ee58d-6b24-4954-ab15-2edb037a52bb" facs="#m-81ad07ed-94a2-440e-b855-090e3b3cdc33" label="lyrics-like">per mi-se-ri-córdi-am Dé-i requi-éscant in páce.</l><l xml:id="m-b3643cb1-0bcd-4986-985a-af0872a522a0" facs="#m-74627d44-789e-4692-8e24-fbeab6709924" label="ambiguous">Amen.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>